{
    "background_story": "Legend was a majestic thoroughbred with a gleaming black coat and a regal demeanor. Bred for greatness, he was trained by the finest equestrians and competed in the most prestigious racing events. With his powerful physique and effortless stride, Legend dominated the tracks, earning a reputation as a distinguished champion. His most notable victory was at the esteemed Golden Cup, where he broke a decades-old record, leaving the crowd in awe. As he retired from racing, Legend's legacy continued to inspire new generations of horses and riders. He was inducted into the Racing Hall of Fame, and his name became synonymous with excellence and distinction. Even in his golden years, Legend remained a proud and dignified steed, his distinguished career forever etched in the annals of equestrian history.",
